# Keep Docker build context small and reproducible.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
# NOTE: do NOT exclude the whole .husky directory — the root package.json's
# `prepare` runs `node .husky/install.mjs`, so that file must be in the build
# context. Only Husky's generated runtime dir is excluded.
.husky/_
docs

**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# Never send local env files into the build context.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
